==Vowels==
Dutch has an extensive [[vowel]] inventory consisting of thirteen plain vowels and at least three diphthongs. Vowels can be grouped as front unrounded, front rounded, central and back. They are also traditionally distinguished by [[Vowel length|length]] or [[tenseness]]. The vowels {{IPA|/eː, øː, oː/}} are included in one of the diphthong charts below because Northern Standard Dutch realises them as diphthongs, but they behave phonologically like the other long monophthongs.

